# Grug brain

Simplification beats extra architecture. Ship the current version's task.

- Do not add services, packages, layers, or abstractions this version does not need
- Prefer a few obvious files over "the right" enterprise layout
- Default run is Docker Compose (API, Postgres, MinIO, Kafka, worker). Host `dotnet` is only for debugging the API with breakpoints
- Skip future versions (real MediaPipe, JWT, Redis) until we are building that version
